b of memory per request wastes over sixty percent of precious VRAM in dark, empty slots.", "text": "As users pile in, reserving one huge contiguous slab of memory per request wastes over sixty percent of precious V ram in dark, empty slots.", "duration": 9.45, "hold": 0.35, "words": [{"text": "As", "start": 0.225, "end": 0.375}, {"text": "users", "start": 0.375, "end": 0.787}, {"text": "pile", "start": 0.787, "end": 1.113}, {"text": "in", "start": 1.113, "end": 1.55}, {"text": "reserving", "start": 1.65, "end": 2.163}, {"text": "one", "start": 2.163, "end": 2.413}, {"text": "huge", "start": 2.413, "end": 2.775}, {"text": "contiguous", "start": 2.775, "end": 3.35}, {"text": "slab", "start": 3.35, "end": 3.638}, {"text": "of", "start": 3.638, "end": 3.725}, {"text": "memory", "start": 3.725, "end": 4.362}, {"text": "per", "start": 4.362, "end": 4.525}, {"text": "request", "start": 4.525, "end": 5.013}, {"text": "wastes", "start": 5.013, "end": 5.45}, {"text": "over", "start": 5.45, "end": 5.713}, {"text": "sixty", "start": 5.713, "end": 6.075}, {"text": "percent", "start": 6.075, "end": 6.487}, {"text": "of", "start": 6.487, "end": 6.6}, {"text": "precious", "start": 6.6, "end": 7.0}, {"text": "V", "start": 7.0, "end": 7.175}, {"text": "ram", "start": 7.175, "end": 7.525}, {"text": "in", "start": 7.525, "end": 7.675}, {"text": "dark", "start": 7.675, "end": 8.15}, {"text": "empty", "start": 8.25, "end": 8.575}, {"text": "slots", "start": 8.575, "end": 9.225}]}, {"wav": "paged-1-b81fedad6e61.wav", "say": "PagedAttention borrows virtual memory from operating systems. It slices every KV cache into fixed-size physical blocks scattered across GPU memory, linked by a page table. Fragmentation collapses to near zero, and shared system prompts reuse the exact same physical blocks.", "text": "paged attention borrows virtual memory from operating systems. It slices every K V cache into fixed-size physical blocks scattered across G P U memory, linked by a page table. Fragmentation collapses to near zero, and shared system prompts reuse the exact same physical blocks.", "duration": 18.59, "hold": 0.45, "words": [{"text": "paged", "start": 0.225, "end": 0.537}, {"text": "attention", "start": 0.537, "end": 1.275}, {"text": "borrows", "start": 1.275, "end": 1.688}, {"text": "virtual", "start": 1.688, "end": 2.025}, {"text": "memory", "start": 2.025, "end": 2.475}, {"text": "from", "start": 2.475, "end": 2.663}, {"text": "operating", "start": 2.663, "end": 3.225}, {"text": "systems", "start": 3.225, "end": 3.925}, {"text": "It", "start": 4.545, "end": 4.67}, {"text": "slices", "start": 4.67, "end": 5.133}, {"text": "every", "start": 5.133, "end": 5.458}, {"text": "K", "start": 5.458, "end": 5.745}, {"text": "V", "start": 5.745, "end": 5.933}, {"text": "cache", "start": 5.933, "end": 6.258}, {"text": "into", "start": 6.258, "end": 6.482}, {"text": "fixed-size", "start": 6.482, "end": 7.095}, {"text": "physical", "start": 7.095, "end": 7.47}, {"text": "blocks", "start": 7.47, "end": 8.183}, {"text": "scattered", "start": 8.183, "end": 8.658}, {"text": "across", "start": 8.658, "end": 9.008}, {"text": "G", "start": 9.008, "end": 9.22}, {"text": "P", "start": 9.22, "end": 9.42}, {"text": "U", "start": 9.42, "end": 9.533}, {"text": "memory", "start": 9.533, "end": 10.145}, {"text": "linked", "start": 10.283, "end": 10.62}, {"text": "by", "start": 10.62, "end": 10.795}, {"text": "a", "start": 10.795, "end": 10.87}, {"text": "page", "start": 10.87, "end": 11.195}, {"text": "table", "start": 11.195, "end": 11.82}, {"text": "Fragmentation", "start": 12.465, "end": 13.265}, {"text": "collapses", "start": 13.265, "end": 13.815}, {"text": "to", "start": 13.815, "end": 13.915}, {"text": "near", "start": 13.915, "end": 14.14}, {"text": "zero", "start": 14.14, "end": 14.74}, {"text": "and", "start": 14.865, "end": 15.002}, {"text": "shared", "start": 15.002, "end": 15.315}, {"text": "system", "start": 15.315, "end": 15.69}, {"text": "prompts", "start": 15.69,