: "Four-times throughput, zero quality loss", "beats": [{"wav": "finale-0-5a3571c2327e.wav", "say": "Combine paged KV memory with speculative verification, and idle GPU bandwidth turns into four-times faster generation with zero quality loss. Every token still obeys the giant model's true distribution. Draft cheap. Verify in parallel. Prove exact.", "text": "Combine paged K V memory with speculative verification, and idle G P U bandwidth turns into four-times faster generation with zero quality loss. Every token still obeys the giant model's true distribution. Draft cheap. Verify in parallel. Prove exact.", "duration": 19.555, "hold": 1.4, "words": [{"text": "Combine", "start": 0.225, "end": 0.713}, {"text": "paged", "start": 0.713, "end": 1.113}, {"text": "K", "start": 1.113, "end": 1.4}, {"text": "V", "start": 1.4, "end": 1.575}, {"text": "memory", "start": 1.575, "end": 2.025}, {"text": "with", "start": 2.025, "end": 2.2}, {"text": "speculative", "start": 2.2, "end": 2.775}, {"text": "verification", "start": 2.775, "end": 3.85}, {"text": "and", "start": 3.95, "end": 4.112}, {"text": "idle", "start": 4.112, "end": 4.463}, {"text": "G", "start": 4.463, "end": 4.688}, {"text": "P", "start": 4.688, "end": 4.9}, {"text": "U", "start": 4.9, "end": 5.075}, {"text": "bandwidth", "start": 5.075, "end": 5.763}, {"text": "turns", "start": 5.763, "end": 6.088}, {"text": "into", "start": 6.088, "end": 6.338}, {"text": "four-times", "start": 6.338, "end": 6.912}, {"text": "faster", "start": 6.912, "end": 7.35}, {"text": "generation", "start": 7.35, "end": 8.213}, {"text": "with", "start": 8.213, "end": 8.412}, {"text": "zero", "start": 8.412, "end": 8.8}, {"text": "quality", "start": 8.8, "end": 9.225}, {"text": "loss", "start": 9.225, "end": 9.825}, {"text": "Every", "start": 10.47, "end": 10.745}, {"text": "token", "start": 10.745, "end": 11.107}, {"text": "still", "start": 11.107, "end": 11.607}, {"text": "obeys", "start": 11.607, "end": 11.982}, {"text": "the", "start": 11